    doc('BASELINE_REPRODUCTION.md',f'''# Baseline reproduction\n\nThe frozen Development three-fold, unweighted mean RMSE values reproduced exactly within the required 0.001 mV tolerance: P0={b['P0']:.6f} mV, P1={b['P1']:.6f} mV, P2={b['P2']:.6f} mV, RS={b['RS']:.6f} mV. No neural model was retrained. Source: `outputs/reproduction/baseline_reproduction.csv`.\n\nThe inherited decomposition audit remains the source of the P1/P2 shared-B and squared-error identity check; this phase did not modify it.''')
