    doc('INDEPENDENT_ERROR_EVENT_AUDIT.md',f'''# Independent error-event audit\n\nGlobal de-duplicated train OOF events: E1={int(e_train.get('E1_predicted_mixed_true_nonmixed',0))}, E2={int(e_train.get('E2_predicted_nonmixed_true_mixed',0))}. Development Validation events: E1={int(e_val.get('E1_predicted_mixed_true_nonmixed',0))}, E2={int(e_val.get('E2_predicted_nonmixed_true_mixed',0))}. Events merge repeated origins at a target timestamp and only merge adjacent half-hour timestamps of the same type within a temporal segment.\n\nTrain E1 has mean q_true={e1tr.true_q.mean():.3f}, q_pred={e1tr.predicted_q.mean():.3f}, probability={e1tr.predicted_probability.mean():.3f}, current absolute error={e1tr.current_abs_error_A.mean():.2f} A. Validation E1 is similar: 0.000, {e1va.predicted_q.mean():.3f}, {e1va.predicted_probability.mean():.3f}, {e1va.current_abs_error_A.mean():.2f} A. Evidence: event CSVs in `outputs/train_oof` and `outputs/events`.''')
