    doc('FOLD1_12H_COUNTERFACTUAL.md',f'''# Fold1 / 12 h counterfactual\n\nAll 233 common valid Fold1 12-hour points: CF00={r1.CF00_RMSE_mV:.3f}, CF10={r1.CF10_RMSE_mV:.3f}, CF01={r1.CF01_RMSE_mV:.3f}, CF11={r1.CF11_RMSE_mV:.3f} mV. Replacing q alone provides the large reduction; replacing conditional on-current mean/std alone is slightly adverse in this scope. The combined Oracle intervention is close to q-only but not better.\n\nEvidence: `outputs/fold1_12h/fold1_12h_counterfactual.csv` and pointwise data.''')
